  "description": "Kim Yu-jin, in the second chapter of her life, retracing to the 1910s, conquers history with her future knowledge. A Korean company commander died trying to save a child from Letona, who was rolling down the hill. When I came to my senses, I had reverted to being Kim Yu-jin, a Korean-American in the 1900s, with knowledge of the future. Will those who know the future become chaebols, or will they?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68521464), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B2%80%EC%9D%80%EB%A8%B8%EB%A6%AC-%EB%AF%B8%EA%B5%B0-%EB%8C%80%EC%9B%90%EC%88%98/4772)",
